  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013865",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-128478",
      "knowledge_point_id": "32df8909-a239-5167-b8ea-412f7cdaea93",
      "knowledge_point": "Identifying Singular Matrices",
      "problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $F$ given below?\n\nI. $det(F)=-7$\n\nII. $F$ is **not** a singular matrix\n\nIII. $det(F)=-2$\n\n$$\nF=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 8 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(F) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 8 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}|-8|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{aligned}|+3|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(2-3)-8(-1-5)+3(-3-10) \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-1)-8\\cdot (-6)+3\\cdot (-13) \\\\  & =-2+48-39 \\\\  & =7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(F)=7$, the matrix is **not** singular. \n\nTherefore, only statement II is true.",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "None of the given statements are true",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II and III only",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I only",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I and II only",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II only",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "knowledge_point_source_id": 14763,
      "difficulty": "easy",
